      "artist": ".dawn queen.",
      "description": "This swastika motif is based directly on the swastika seals discovered in Pakistani Punjab, from the ancient Indus Valley Civilization. It is the right-facing variant. The swastika motif exists as a perennial tradition in the entirety of Pakistan (from the Gilgit-Baltistan in the north, to Sindh in the south, etc.) to this day in folk culture, art, and symbolism.",
